<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Phithar</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHITHAR ro Nyichiieng pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Phithar</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Phth</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHITHAR</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ro Nyichiieng Pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Nyichiieng pha Phithar ro jigi ne ibi pha dayiingdayang rey dun pha Masiphothek shii zey ro. Hì pha miyao sbang zey pha jine biidiie pha masdothek shii nane ithek muyua pha zab awie pha blia nane siulao shii khriig rek pha yao. Ji pha diigthek shii chang phane Hamangkhung-aphuii ro nane Ithong Isu Masi ro izai khani shii khomuii rone doh ro, hanyie awaithek è Isu shii doh chiih-è yua pha ji aishii è yoi pha khani ji è branthek re-è yoiphi. Hanyie è Masi ne iidoh athog phro ne yua pha ji shii isiie ruii srane zeypho è zey ro. Ai è yao Masi iidoh thog pha chia pha jine nyieliieshii izai Hamangkhung-aphuii ne “hanyie jia shii de mua yi pha ayang ro, jishii zab ne awaithek layog è khid bone yang ro.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Masipho shii ho <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 1:3-21">1:3-21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Biidiie pha masdothek <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 2:1-22">2:1-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Idohhè shii Masi wuii ruii <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2PE 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Isu Masi ro khiao nane guaphasamoy, Simon Phithar re-è—</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Hanyie yi gathek ro Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ragia Isu Masi pha rangsuathek ji è gathek ro igong migi duiine hanyie shii phi pha ji shii hìpha jigi phijong ro:<verse eid="2PE 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Gathek ro khani pha Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Ithong Isu ro bushun nane liijiing ne nathek shii ley è chua ne phi bo.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ho nane gua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii ro hamangkhung blu ne hanyie è awai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">awai ro shii thang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ai re-è.</char></note> ro biisiie nane wiethek shii thang pha ho ro aishii gu è thieg pha khani ji re-è izai giangthek chai shii rai pha zab gethek è chid pha ji phijong ro. <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>Hì duiine ai è sbang rek pha bajo boh nane igong lasenthek phijong ro, ji è ji pha lasenthek è sohjambling pha awie pha chid pha ji è nyayao mua, chiih-è hamangkhung ziig shii nyathang mua. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Hìthek pha chiang è nawai migi shii wie chodo pha nawai ro wie shii khani chodo bo; <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>naro khani shii awai shii zud pha ji shii chodo; nawai ro awai shii zud pha ji è zud pha ji shii chodo bo; nawai ro zud pha ji shii hamangkhung-aphuii duiine è chodo <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>naro hamangkhung-aphuii duii pha ji shii ne khuiino ro miie shii miie chodo bo; chiih-è nathek ro Masipho chun pha ji shii miie chodo bo. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Hìthek pha ichua wie nathek è chid ro, chiih-è nathek zab yi ithek shii bajo um arone, ithek è nathek ro khani pha gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi shii wie nane chun pha rab phi. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Jishii nathek shii jithek oi arone nathek ne ruang ariig mua chiih-è nathek shii buyo layogthek è gang rekjong phi pha ji shii bia dun phro.<verse eid="2PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Ji-è chiihphado, gu iijiiakthek, Hamangkhung-aphuii è ho pha ji shii chiih-è ai è nathek shii ne idang lie um pha ji shii din nede muna gang bidiang bo; nathek è ji rek arone, nathek ne nawaithek migi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nathek migi shii thomuii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">layog shii ley.</char></note> shii khuchungde athoh phro. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Hì pha lumuii è nathek shii ne gethek ro Ithong nane ragia Isu Masi ro idang pha Sajathua shii khud pha ley rangsua phi ruii phro.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Chiih-è hìpha miyao ne gu idang nathek shii now yi pha ro, nathek ne ithek shii thiegjong chiih-è nathek è mua pha izai ji shii ne chuh reyjong ro. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Gu è now shii gu sieng ne rai ba shii hìpha miyaothek pha nathek ro nowkhlei pha ji shii nai pha ne gu shii rangsua um bie ro. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Khthiie gune ji pha iy pha siu shii thoh muii chid gune ji thieg, gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi è gu shii miang è yao. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Gu ne gui è rek muii pha ji rek pha ro, chiihphado, gu iy dun pha iidoh idang pha ishak shii nathek shii hìpha miyaothek now yi pha lumuii phi pha ro.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi ro biisiie shii riigpho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Gathek ne gethek ro Ithong Isu Masi ro riichaiboh ji wuii ruii pha nathek shii thieg yi pha phaluiithek rab ne yao pha ji è ayao ro. Gathek ro mieg è airo zabèboh ji doh ro. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17,18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-5">Mth 17:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-7">Mrg 9:2-7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-35">Lug 9:28-35</ref></char></note> Aishii ne ilab nane Hamangkhung-aphuii Aphuii shii biisiie phi mage shii gathek de thiisa hà um, Bajoboh Biisiie è goh aishii thog mage shii, yao, “Hì ne guiro bushun Dufuii ro, hanyie rog shii gu è sang pha ji ro!” <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Gethek ai rog shii so phiing hà um shii, guithek de ji pha goh ne hamangkhung è wuii ruii pha ji yoi ro, <verse eid="2PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Gethek ne din nede chaigpho re-è yao pha mua shii muna anow dak ro. Nathek ne ji shii isiie rek pha ne nyarek mua, nyieliieshii hìne hamiang pha dadiang yi nathek lubuthek shii chuang ne Inai arey sapho shii ne muchuang khlieng pha duiine ro. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Zab è muna ne hì shii, nowkhlei bo, jigigamthek shii chaig pha ji shii gethek hanyie magunde gethek lum ayao mua phro. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Chiih-è chaigthek ro mua bran è yang pha ji è athog ro, jishii branthek ne Ragung So iliing shii phrai ne ithek yao pha mua jine Hamangkhung-aphuii è thog ro.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Biidiie pha masdothek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Buyo hà biidiie pha chaigthek ne bran duchoi shii khia thog, chiih-è ji duiine biidiie pha masdothek de nathek duchoi shii khia ruii phro. Ithek ne mua yi, biidiie muyuathek ji yie ruii phro, chiih-è ithek ne hanyie è ithek shii khia phi pha Masdo shii snai ruii phro, chiih-è ithek ne hamblo shii awaithek shii mua pha ji yie ruii phro. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Ji-è rangde, bajo ne ithek ro awie pha lumuii jihà luagieng ruii phro, chiih-è nyieliieshii ithek è nyie rek pha ji shii, gaithek ne izai pha Lumuii shii awie pha yao ruii phro. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Ithek ro giichak pha ji è hìpha biidiie masdothek ne nathek shii rab pha phaluiithek yao pha ji è phua yi phro. Bajo ibi è ithek ro Chua phane sarojong ro, chiih-è ithek ro Srobropho ne idang sieng ne rai ro!<verse eid="2PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii è layog rek pho hamangkhliiethek shii athoh ro, jishii ithek shii thumluii hà fen muii, Chua pha Inai pha ithek shii igiia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">shiirnai shii igiia; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">igiia hà phang.</char></note> hà phiing ne rai ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1">Igo 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 7:24">7:24</ref></char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii è ihèg sohjambling shii athoh ro, jishii sohjambling pha hamangkhung-aphuii oi pha branthek shii khokhed noh; jia ragia rey bie jine Noah ro, hanyie è giangthek yua, chiih-è gai miley bran de ragia rey ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:24">Igo 19:24</ref></char></note> Hamangkhung-aphuii è Sodom nane Gomora rajan shii nin, ithek shii bai è ziao muii, chiih-è hamangkhung-aphuii oi pha bran shii nyie rey ruii pha ji ithek shii miiriig rab ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:1-16">Igo 19:1-16</ref></char></note> Ai è wie bran Loth shii ragia rek, hanyie yi Iphey oi pha bran ro zab awie blia è duhug rey ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Ji pha wie bran ne ithek duchoi shii rai, chiih-è inai tham ne diig è duhug rey ne chiih-è ai è ithek ro awie pha bliathek ji riig ne yoi. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Chiih-è giang bran shii chaithek è ragia rek phi pha chiih-è khi èrek ne awie pha bran shii Chua pha Inai shii lago iliing shii ruii pha ji de Hamangkhung-aphuii ne thieg ro, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>hanyie è ithek ro siu zea shii yang phaji luagieng chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii riichai shii khiijaipho ro.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Hì pha biidiie masdothek ne arum nane lawasdai ro, chiih-è lakhung pha biisiiepho shii ilab arek rone doh yi; ji pha chiang shii, ithek shii makhak-riing rek. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Hamangkhliiethek magunde, hanyie yi ithek biidiie pha masdothek è de muna gang nane chuh ba ro jimagunde Ithong moe shii ithek shii nin ne makhak-ariing ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Hì pha branthek ne awaithek ro lajia ne ibeymuthung è awaithek lum ne lajia rek pha ji duiine rek, hanyie shii ne zum ne ua pha giak ro, ithek è agao pha ji è; makhak-riing rog shii joh ro. Ithek ne ibeymuthungthek duiine srobro rey ruii phro, <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>chiih-è ithek è diig phi pha ji è awaithek shii diig phi ruii phro. Awaithek shii sang pha jine sang inai shii rek ne ji è ne ithek siu è chid pha ji shii liingsed ro; ithek ne nathek rog nathek ro michiethek shii dog phane biwo nane awie pha ibeng ro. Ithek zab ne khinrin pha lubo rek ro! <verse eid="2PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Ithek ne hanyie shii de ariig yang ro ji shii siulao rek pha jo ji riig; ithek è yang pha layog ne khuchung de liingsed oi ro. Ithek ne zia bran shii ubong hà phang yi. Ithek ro lubuthek ne giichak pha dab ne ruii ro. Ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro mucho iliing shii ro! <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15,16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:4-35">Ssb 22:4-35</ref></char></note> Ithek ne miang lumuii shii thoh srane ithek ro lumuii ne san dun ro; ithek ne Beor ro dufuii Balam è yie muii pha lumuii shii luagieng ro, hanyie ne awie pha blia rek pha ji è mua pha bang shii miie srane <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>chiih-è airo layog chiang aishii giung. Airo bambao è ne bran goh è yao ro chiih-è chaig ro bi-ìe blia shii gak muii ro.<verse eid="2PE 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Hìthek pha branthek ne gohdun pha gaphieg duiine ro, chiih-è hasamkhanoi è kheydun pha sakhmiingthek duiine ro; Hamangkhung-aphuii è ithek ro ithua ne jam igiia hà ongjong ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Ithek ne wiangwe nane bi-ìe miyaothek yao, chiih-è hanyie yi awie bsa hà rai pha ji è yo pha jao ramuii pha branthek shii awie pha siu pha ji chid pha ji shii bohkhoh ne ubong shii phang muii ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Ithek è ithek shii ichad rek phi phro ne sbang rek—jishii awaithek ne mua pha lajiathek ro khiao rek ba ro—chiih-è nyie è gethek shii zum ruii pha manathek ro khiao ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Branthek yi Ithong nane Ragia Isu Masi pha ithek ro khani è sohjambling pha awie pha blu è yo arone, chiih-è dinne ithek yang yie, ji è rek pha branthek rone iidohè ne igobi è de awie pha rey ruii phro. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Chiih-è ithek shii phi pha ug muyung ji è khid pha ji shii ithek ne giang pha lumuii khuchungde a-ìd ba pha ji wieba ro. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 2:11">Khua 2:11</ref></char></note> Ithek shii nyie rey pha jine khuamiyaothek ne zai ro thoh yi ro: “Choi ne awai è moy pha ji shii iidoh wuii” chiih-è “wak ne sudjong pha ji iidoh wuii ne nyiak shii woi din ro.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ithong wuii ruii pha sbang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Gu iijiiakthek, hìne gu è nathek shii zey pha din pha jigi ro. Nyimanyi pha jigi shii nathek ro khanithek shii hìthek pha manathek shii now yie rone igang munowthek pha ji khia pha bidiang. <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>Gu nathek shii buyo so chaigthek è yao pha miyaogamthek ji nowkhlei yi pha yang ro, chiih-è Ithong nane Ragia ro nyie muyung yi guaphasamoythek è phi pha jine nathek shii de now yi. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:18">Jud 18</ref></char></note> Zab è igobi, nathek ne gao chid hìpha iidohè pha inai shii chai ne awai è yang pha phrai muii pha ji ruii pha branthek khia ruii phro. Ithek ne nathek shii siakjo ruii phro <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>chiih-è sai ruii, “Ai wuii pha sbang arek bey? Ai ne khihà lei? Gethek ro blangthek ne iyjong ro, jishii zab ne sohjambling rab pha ishak è thuh ò ro!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:6-9">Igo 1:6-9</ref></char></note> Ithek ne buyo Hamangkhung-aphuii è yung ne, hamangkhungthek nane sohnyiak ne rab pha izai ji shii ne snai muii ro. Sohnyiak ne kho shii kho è rey, <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 7:11">Igo 7:11</ref></char></note> chiih-è hìne kho è ro, Kho è khokhed pha ji è, ihèg sohjambling ne srobro rey dun ro. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Jishii hamangkhungthek nane sohnyiak thuh shii um pha jine Hamangkhung-aphuii ro ò muyung ji è ruii ro, nyieliieshii bai è srobro rek pha ji ruii ro. Ithek shii ne giang asi pha branthek shii chua ne srobro pha inai shii ruii phro.<verse eid="2PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:4">Chng 90:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jishii mana jia shii abia rabo, gu iijiiakthek! Hamangkhung-aphuii mieg ibi shii ne inai jia nane itham idamthek duchoi shii yo oi ro; aishii ne nyi ne ò ro. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Giak è now pha duiine, Ithong ne awai è sbang rek pha jine achia phro. Ji pha chiang shii, ai ne nathek rog shii lubuphiang rek, nyieliieshii ai ne hanyie jia shii srobro rek yi pha ayang ro, jishii zab ne awaithek ro layogthek è khid bone yang ro.<verse eid="2PE 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mth 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Lug 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:2">1The 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 16:15">Dng 16:15</ref></char>
    </note> Jishii Ithong wuii pha inai shii ne mugopho duiine wuii ruii phro. Ji pha Inai shii ne hamangkhungthek ne awiedang pha ro srane san ruii phro, hamangkhung pha hasiang, habie nane dadiangthek ne hùb ne srobro rey ruii phro, chiih-è sohnyiak shii nyie um pha ji rog pha zab ne san ruii phro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">san din dun; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dohdin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">gai um </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ziao muii; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jia ne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">dohdin ne srobro reyjong.</char></note> <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Zab pha manathek ne hì duiine srobro rey dun, nathek khi-èrek pha branthek um chid pha lei? Nathek ro chaithek ne so um chid chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii phi muii pha um chid, <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>nathek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Inai khan shii chiih-è nathek khama rek muii pha ji rek ne khthiie wuii pha rab bo—hamangkhungthek hùb ruii ne mua mage pha Inai shii, chiih-è hamangkhung pha hasiang, habie nane dadiangthek ne chieg ne lieng ruii phro. <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Aij 65:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:1">Dng 21:1</ref></char></note>Jishii gethek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è iwo hamangkhungthek nane iwo sohnyiak shii sbang rek pha ji khan bo: Thiisa pha hò hàne zab giangthek um ruii phro.<verse eid="2PE 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Chiih-è ji-è, gu iijiiakthek, nathek ji pha Inai khan shii, nawaithek khama rek mua pha ji rek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii mieg ibi shii gang nane ichiig oi pha chiih-è ai rog shii liijiing rek bo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Ai è nathek shii ragia rey yie pha ishak phi pha ji shii gathek ro, Hamangkhung-aphuii è aishii phi pha khani shii khoh gathek ro iijiiak Phaul è nathek shii zey pha duiine Ithong ro lubu phyiang shii riig bo. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Hì ne ai è hì chiang shii nyie yao pha ji airo zab jigithek shii zey. Ichiih pha jigi shii ne athieg pha diig manathek um hì shii ne khani oi pha nane chuh asi pha branthek è biidiie è yua muii ro, ithek ne Jigithek pha gai ithothek shii de ji asi pha jihà yua ro. Ji-è ithek ne awaithek lakhung shii awaithek ro srobro ji yie ro.<verse eid="2PE 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Jishii, gu iijiiakthek, nathek hìne khuchung mujo thiegjong. Chiihphado, ji-è Iphey oi pha branthek asi pha lumuii hà anoh yie pha chiih-è nawaithek ro ragia pha ithua è achiih yi pha, nawaithek shii ragia rek bo. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Jishii gethek ro Ithong nane Ragia Isu Masi ro bushun nane khani shii idang sey bo. Biisiie ne, thuh chiih-è idang airo ro! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
